Codes for HPC
Login: ssh -y divesh@172.27.4.2
Logout: logout
Submit job: qsub job.pbs
Kill or end a job: qdel -W force <job id>
See running jobs: qstat
	qstat -u divesh
	qstat -n
Status of all the nodes: pbsnodes -aSj
To get the error output: > <file_name>.out 2>&1
To download/copy file from HPC to PC: scp -r divesh@172.27.4.2:/home/divesh/QRC/<filename>.txt
To Send to HPC (go to the folder containing file): scp <filename> divesh@172.27.4.2:/home/divesh/QRC/
